{
  "title": "Stacked directions",
  "description": "Directions sharing a position and an orientation are displayed stacked outward from the staff, in the order they appear in the array — the first is nearest the notes. That ordering is all a renderer needs to place several instructions at one point. No direction says how far from the staff it belongs, and none needs to. Proposed MNX objects, not yet adopted — see roadmap/proposed/score-text.md.",
